ents\".\nSEC. 2. Section 5 of Executive Order No. 11821 of November 27, 1974 is amended by deleting \"December 31, 1976\" and substituting therefor \"December 31, 1977\".\nGERALD R. FORD\nThe White House,\nDecember 31, 1976.","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-opus_zip-11949-6beee7f4ce.txt","sha256":"13eb18cd0d33234bc65cb24329f86a248b4bfb54792595adcbbe739ecdb028dd","source":{"line":770,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"53df1196c9c1143c875776108384ca40a36cb8239799130f103ee463be50e1db"}},{"first_1500_characters":"presidential documents\nTitle 3—The President\nExecutive Order 11949 December 31, 1976\nEconomic Impact Statements\nBy virtue o f the authority vested in me by the Constitution and statutes o f the \nU nited States o f Am erica, and as President o f the U nited States o f Am erica, it is \nhereby ordered as follow s:\nSection  1. T h e title o f Executive O rder N o. 11821 o f Novem ber 27, 1974 is \namended to read “ E conom ic Im pact Statements” .\nSec,. 2. Section 5 o f Executive O rder N o. 11821 o f Novem ber 27, 1974 is amended \nby deleting “ D ecem ber 31,1976”  and substituting therefor “ D ecem ber 31, 1977” .\nT h e W h ite H ouse ,\nDecem ber 31, 1976.\n[FR Doc.77-555 Filed l-fc-77;10:27 am]\nEd ito rial N o t e: The President’s statement of Dec. 31, 1976, on economic impact state­\nments, is printed in the Weekly Compilation of Presidential Documents (voL 13, no. 2).\nFEDERAL REGISTER, VOL. 42, N O . 3— WEDNESDAY, JANUARY 5, 1977\n\f","path":"jobs/opus-media-match/output/text/4140943ec1249fc8d5e49a2aeaf70f75119d55787b0b4b3d9af7ecfd1f55f159.txt","sha256":"2193bc4fdb991d1d8052f2645b3c3968404dfcaa726918e5dc40754c8a48d250","source":{"line":374,"path":"jobs/opus-media-match/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"71431369547dcff2b9f38b7291a0e62a5431f15ce2dd83c801a1d18ae2d7fb62"}}]}
